[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
id = &"human_winter_night"
; The human winter after dark (L89-5): human_winter blends here as the sun goes
; down (its night_look). Light only, never a darker screen: exposure, saturation
; and contrast stay the day's, while the overcast sky, the ambient and the fog
; fall to a cold low night, so in the cottage the hearth and the moon through the
; door carry the room and the corners go dark (R3: horror by local light and fog).
